[
    {
        "content": "<p>In some work I was doing, I found myself needing facts like <code>sSup (a • s) = a • sSup s</code> where <code>s : Set ℝ</code> and <code>a : ℝ≥0</code>. This led me to the file with <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Real.sInf_smul_of_nonneg#doc\">docs#Real.sInf_smul_of_nonneg</a>, and there is a TODO noting that all these lemmas are true for a conditionally complete linear order with <code>sSup ∅ = sInf ∅ = 0</code>. In Mathlib, this includes at least <code>ℕ</code>, <code>ℤ</code>, <code>Cardinal</code>, <code>Ordinal</code>, <code>ℝ</code>, and <code>ℝ≥0</code>. I figured I may as well make this generalization, which would ultimately subsume a few 10s of extant lemmas in Mathlib and automatically bequeath some lemmas for, e.g., the action of <code>ℚ</code> on <code>ℝ</code>.</p>\n<p>To do this, on top of <code>sSup ∅ = sInf ∅ = 0</code> I need that scalar multiplication has a left/right adjoint in the sense of a <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=GaloisConnection#doc\">docs#GaloisConnection</a>. That occurs, for instance, when there's  a <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=FloorDiv#doc\">docs#FloorDiv</a> or <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=CeilDiv#doc\">docs#CeilDiv</a> instance, or whenever you have something like <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=OrderIso.smulRightDual#doc\">docs#OrderIso.smulRightDual</a> hanging around.</p>\n<p>Before embarking on this road, I was hoping to get some feedback on (a) whether the generalization is worth it given it will cause a good chunk of churn, and (b) if the following is a reasonable approach:</p>\n<p>Step 1: Add the following four type classes and prove the generalized lemmas about these objects:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">SupSetEmptyZero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Zero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">SupSet</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">sSup_empty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sSup</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∅</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">InfSetEmptyZero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Zero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">InfSet</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">sInf_empty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sInf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∅</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- Scalar multiplication by any `0 &lt; a` has a right adjoint, and so preserves suprema. -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsSMulLeftAdjoint</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Zero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Preorder</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Preorder</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">SMul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"sd\">/-- For `0 &lt; a`, the map `a • ·` is a left adjoint. -/</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">exists_gc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⦃</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">⦄</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">GaloisConnection</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">•</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- Scalar multiplication by any `0 &lt; a` has a left adjoint, and so preserves infima. -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsSMulRightAdjoint</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Zero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Preorder</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Preorder</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">SMul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"sd\">/-- For `0 &lt; a`, the map `a • ·` is a right adjoint. -/</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">exists_gc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⦃</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">⦄</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">GaloisConnection</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">•</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Note that to avoid potential diamond issues, these are stated as existence props.</p>\n<p>Step 2: Setup some instances such as the below:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">section</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">GroupWithZero</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">GroupWithZero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Preorder</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Preorder</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MulAction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">PosSMulMono</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">PosSMulReflectLE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- An invertible scalar has `a⁻¹ • ·` as its adjoint. -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">GroupWithZero</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">instIsSMulLeftAdjoint</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsSMulLeftAdjoint</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ha</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">_⁻¹</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">•</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"o\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">le_inv_smul_iff_of_pos</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ha</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">symm</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- An invertible scalar has `a⁻¹ • ·` as its adjoint. -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">GroupWithZero</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isSMulRightAdjoint</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsSMulRightAdjoint</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ha</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">_⁻¹</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">•</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"o\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inv_smul_le_iff_of_pos</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ha</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">GroupWithZero</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">section</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ConditionallyCompleteLinearOrderBot</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ConditionallyCompleteLinearOrderBot</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">instSupSetEmptyZeroOfIsBotZeroClass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">ConditionallyCompleteLinearOrderBot</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Zero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">IsBotZeroClass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">SupSetEmptyZero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">sSup_empty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">csSup_empty</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">trans</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bot_eq_zero</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ConditionallyCompleteLinearOrderBot</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Step 3: Go through the long list of generalizations, deprecations, and internal mathlib references.</p>",
